sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend<br/>+page.svelte
    participant API as api.ts
    participant BE as Backend<br/>chat.router.ts
    participant Store as profileStore<br/>(disk)
    participant MS as Model Service<br/>routers/chat.py
    participant ER as EmotionalReasoning<br/>Agent
    participant LR as LLMReasoning<br/>Agent
    participant LLM as LLM provider

    User->>UI: types message + enter
    UI->>API: sendChat(text)
    API->>BE: POST /api/v1/chat
    BE->>Store: getHistory(profileId)
    Store-->>BE: last 20 messages
    BE->>MS: POST /api/v1/chat {message, history}

    Note over MS: reads WS session<br/>emotion_buffer + transcript_buffer

    MS->>ER: analyse(emotion_obs, transcript)
    ER-->>MS: "user appears frustrated…"
    MS->>LR: reason(text, emotion_ctx, history, transcript)
    LR->>LLM: chat(messages)
    LLM-->>LR: assistant reply
    LR-->>MS: reply
    MS-->>BE: {response}
    BE->>Store: append user + agent messages
    BE-->>API: {response}
    API-->>UI: reply
    UI->>User: render
